            "review_title": "Review at Namunamu Beach Bar",
            "review_text": "batsauce\nBerlin, Germany112 contributions\n0\nNice beachfront place for a few drinks\nDec 2016 • Couples\nThis bar/coffee spot has very beach front tables. Their coffee juices are quite good and reasonably priced. The Bar is part of a complex, with an adjoining nightclub and restaurant. Their food offered is almost entirely western BUT they have no on-site kitchen. Therefore if you order food, it will be cooked at their nearby sister restaurant and delivered. SO, the food is not as hot and crispy as it would otherwise be at their nearby restaurant with the same namesake. I would recommend more so for the liquid portion of their menu.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 21, 2016",
